  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "Canopy-dwellers of the deep woods who prize cunning artistry over any written law.",
    "one_paragraph": "The Ailuun carve homes into living trunks, veil rank behind ritual masks, and teach that truth is too wild to be spoken without indirection. Beauty and ambush are siblings in their worldview. Their people trade lacquer, dyes, and songs to outsiders, but they reserve their deepest lore for moonlit circles where hunters, poets, and hedge-mages debate fate through dance and deception."
